ational energy often involve the Schrödinger’s equation with the Hamiltonian operator."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d01", "start": 417, "end": 609, "text": "The computers that process this massive calculation can incorporate the molecule’s kinetic energy as well as the vast number of repulsions and columbic attractions between subatomic particles."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d01", "start": 610, "end": 712, "text": "The calculations are said to be very costly, as they are difficult and take a long time to accomplish."}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d02", "start": 0, "end": 142, "text": "English (U.S.), English (U.K.), German (Germany), French (France), Spanish (Spain), Japanese, Chinese (Traditional), and Chinese (Simplified)."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d02", "start": 143, "end": 280, "text": "In addition, the software comes with an interactive tutorial, which can be used to train both the user and the speech recognition engine."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d02", "start": 281, "end": 439, "text": "In addition to all the features provided in Windows Vista, Windows 7 provides a wizard for setting up the microphone and a tutorial on how to use the feature."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d02", "start": 440, "end": 519, "text": "All Mac OS X computers come pre-installed with the speech recognition software."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d02", "start": 520, "end": 643, "text": "The software is user independent, and it allows for a user to, \"navigate menus and enter keyboard shortcuts; speak checkbox"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0309-826a2c37e564:d03", "start": 0, "end": 42, "text": "results in a misdiagnosis of asthma alone."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc